BookShelf bundles two Apache-2.0 projects:

- PDF.js 3.11.174 (Mozilla), used to draw PDF pages inside the reader WebView.
  https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
- OpenCC simplified-to-traditional character and phrase tables, used only as a display
  conversion when 竖排繁体 is on. The original book file is not rewritten.
  https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC

PalmDOC decompression follows the published MobileRead compression notes.
It is packaging, not a DRM removal step. Encrypted AZW3 files are refused.
